WEBVTT

00:01.980 --> 00:04.300
I heard you were reckless again.

00:04.650 --> 00:06.150
Seriously...

00:06.660 --> 00:09.360
It wasn't that big of a deal.

00:09.690 --> 00:12.760
You don't think being stabbed 
by Akashia's a big deal?

00:12.760 --> 00:14.180
Are you okay?

00:14.180 --> 00:15.460
I'm fine.

00:15.460 --> 00:18.330
And Irityrdia was successfully terminated.

00:18.330 --> 00:21.040
That's not the issue here.

00:21.040 --> 00:23.980
There weren't any problems.

00:23.980 --> 00:27.500
I knew Oscar would be able to pull it off.

00:28.020 --> 00:30.010
Aren't you trusting him a little too much?

00:30.010 --> 00:31.770
That's not true.

00:31.770 --> 00:32.540
So?

00:32.540 --> 00:34.100
What are you going to do now?

00:34.100 --> 00:34.720
What?

00:34.720 --> 00:36.800
The contract was for one year, wasn't it?

00:38.210 --> 00:39.690
That's right.

00:44.550 --> 00:45.790
What?

00:46.510 --> 00:48.800
Don't do something you'll regret.

02:22.240 --> 02:27.000
~ The Things Unknown ~

02:27.650 --> 02:30.080
Next month is the new year, huh?

02:30.080 --> 02:31.460
Time sure flies.

02:31.460 --> 02:32.840
You're telling me.

02:32.840 --> 02:35.650
That said, even after 
all of the trouble we faced,

02:35.650 --> 02:38.670
we somehow managed to survive another year.

02:38.670 --> 02:44.600
If His Majesty would find a queen, 
we'd have no worries going into the new year.

02:44.600 --> 02:48.700
If Miss Tinasha were willing, 
that'd be the fastest way.

02:48.700 --> 02:53.050
She'd be the most beautiful queen 
in our history for sure!

02:53.050 --> 02:54.400
But she's a witch.

02:54.700 --> 02:56.770
I stand opposed to the idea.

02:56.770 --> 02:58.360
Mister Norman.

02:58.360 --> 03:01.370
<b>Norman    Farsas Civil Servant</b>

02:58.650 --> 03:01.360
There are plenty of other candidates.

03:01.360 --> 03:05.000
I can't accept a witch 
as our queen, even as a joke.

03:05.000 --> 03:06.450
Well...

03:06.450 --> 03:10.600
She may be a witch, 
but she's the queen of Tuldarr!

03:10.600 --> 03:11.990
A queen, you say?

03:11.990 --> 03:14.900
We're talking about a long gone nation here.

03:14.900 --> 03:15.850
Still...

03:21.930 --> 03:24.180
If you were listening, 
that makes things easier.

03:24.180 --> 03:29.640
As long as His Majesty obsesses over you, 
this kingdom will never have a queen.

03:29.640 --> 03:31.200
Hey, Norman...

03:31.200 --> 03:32.370
It's fine.

03:35.060 --> 03:35.740
However—

03:35.740 --> 03:38.610
I hear your contract is due to expire shortly.

03:40.020 --> 03:43.700
You'll clean up after yourself, won't you?

03:46.010 --> 03:49.040
I could erase Oscar's memories, if you'd like.

03:49.040 --> 03:51.660
Lady Tinasha, that's going too far.

03:51.660 --> 03:55.440
But if Oscar found out, 
he'd be extremely angry.

03:55.440 --> 03:57.460
We'll have to go about it carefully.

03:58.420 --> 04:00.780
As long as you're aware.

04:00.780 --> 04:02.930
Do remember where you stand here.

04:05.390 --> 04:06.320
Why, you!

04:06.320 --> 04:07.530
How dare you say that!

04:07.530 --> 04:09.100
Calm down, Pamyra.

04:09.100 --> 04:10.100
It's fine.

04:10.370 --> 04:13.060
Witches are a danger and a calamity.

04:13.660 --> 04:17.970
It's a fact that we 
are meant to be loathed.

04:23.590 --> 04:26.160
You're too forgiving, Lady Tinasha.

04:26.490 --> 04:28.360
That's not true at all.

04:28.360 --> 04:32.870
I just think I shouldn't forget 
what I really am.

04:33.340 --> 04:35.460
Were you serious about that suggestion?

04:35.830 --> 04:38.420
I'll do it, if that's what's necessary.

04:38.420 --> 04:43.070
But if you do that, he'll forget all about you!

04:43.630 --> 04:48.140
Even if he forgets, 
it's fine as long as I still remember.

04:48.440 --> 04:51.580
I'm fine as long as he lives 
a normal, happy life.

04:51.580 --> 04:53.850
That'll make me happy, too.

04:54.570 --> 04:56.090
Lady Tinasha...

04:56.740 --> 05:02.530
But even if I don't interfere, 
that man will carry out his duties.

05:02.990 --> 05:04.850
He's a strong person.

05:04.850 --> 05:06.890
Much stronger than I am...

05:08.220 --> 05:10.530
I wonder why I'm still alive.

05:10.840 --> 05:12.700
Don't be ridiculous!

05:13.770 --> 05:19.180
If you want to die, then live among 
people and die as a human!

05:19.180 --> 05:20.840
I don't want it any other way!

05:20.840 --> 05:22.110
Pamyra.

05:28.260 --> 05:30.950
Please find your own happiness.

05:31.770 --> 05:33.720
That's my wish for you!

05:33.980 --> 05:36.180
I'm plenty happy already.

05:36.180 --> 05:37.230
Thank you.

05:39.530 --> 05:41.980
Look, the sky's beautiful.

05:53.900 --> 05:56.170
Maybe a year was too long.

06:00.700 --> 06:01.700
Oscar.

06:08.220 --> 06:09.280
Tinasha.

06:09.280 --> 06:10.550
Is something wrong?

06:11.020 --> 06:12.890
Not really.

06:16.730 --> 06:18.980
Here, a gift for you.

06:23.820 --> 06:24.630
What's this?

06:24.980 --> 06:27.250
Just for your enjoyment.

06:27.250 --> 06:29.180
The sky tonight was really pretty.

06:29.830 --> 06:30.780
Thanks.

06:35.570 --> 06:37.610
So? Did something happen?

06:37.610 --> 06:38.850
Why do you ask?

06:40.900 --> 06:42.540
You look a bit sad.

06:43.930 --> 06:45.250
I'm doing fine.

06:47.130 --> 06:48.870
Wh-What now?

06:48.870 --> 06:52.120
Well, you were just about to cast something.

06:52.120 --> 06:53.350
What spell was it?

06:53.970 --> 06:57.900
You really are superhuman.

06:57.900 --> 06:59.490
It's nothing.

06:59.490 --> 07:02.560
I just wanted to test out 
a psychological spell.

07:02.560 --> 07:06.390
I don't really get it, but tell me 
before you try anything.

07:07.570 --> 07:10.100
So, is something bothering you?

07:10.670 --> 07:13.990
Just been thinking about my life.

07:13.990 --> 07:16.730
You can just marry me, you know.

07:16.730 --> 07:17.660
Not happening.

07:17.660 --> 07:18.900
How stubborn.

07:19.460 --> 07:22.420
Just marry me and quit being a witch.

07:23.620 --> 07:25.690
How would I quit, exactly?

07:25.690 --> 07:28.130
You just need to go back to aging normally.

07:28.530 --> 07:30.730
Aging, you say?

07:32.250 --> 07:33.920
How many decades do you have left?

07:33.920 --> 07:34.920
It's more than enough.

07:34.920 --> 07:36.050
Share them with me.

07:36.360 --> 07:39.660
You really have strange taste in women.

07:39.660 --> 07:40.720
Shut up.

07:40.720 --> 07:42.090
She means a lot to me.

07:42.090 --> 07:43.460
Don't you badmouth her.

07:50.590 --> 07:53.490
You really should stop doing that.

07:54.660 --> 07:56.390
Push me away if you don't like it.

07:57.010 --> 07:58.450
How do I put it?

07:58.900 --> 08:03.100
I know part of it is just because 
I'm used to your touch,

08:03.510 --> 08:07.090
but you really are special to me.

08:09.420 --> 08:10.690
Is something wrong?

08:11.440 --> 08:12.300
No.

08:22.000 --> 08:24.880
Oscar, you shouldn't.

08:24.880 --> 08:25.660
Why not?

08:26.460 --> 08:27.590
Why not, you say?

08:29.500 --> 08:30.490
Why not?

08:31.540 --> 08:33.200
Come up with your own answer.

08:42.330 --> 08:43.330
What is it?

08:43.830 --> 08:46.320
Sorry for disturbing you so late.

08:46.320 --> 08:47.850
Please check these urgently...

08:50.020 --> 08:53.670
I'd be well justified to kill you right now.

08:53.670 --> 08:55.680
Wh-Why's that?!

09:01.210 --> 09:02.090
Oscar!

09:08.410 --> 09:09.230
What's that?

09:09.730 --> 09:11.910
The castle's barrier has been broken.

09:15.020 --> 09:16.040
What's going on?!

09:16.040 --> 09:16.760
Over here!

09:26.020 --> 09:27.730
Surround each one with at least three men!

09:27.730 --> 09:29.050
Don't leave any openings!

09:29.050 --> 09:31.130
If you can't fight, don't come out here!

09:31.400 --> 09:32.240
What?

09:32.240 --> 09:33.500
What is all this?

09:40.180 --> 09:41.330
Get lost.

09:47.970 --> 09:48.730
Are you hurt?

09:49.140 --> 09:51.690
No, I'm fine.

09:51.690 --> 09:53.720
Then go inside the castle.

09:53.720 --> 09:55.740
Don't come out until it's all over.

09:55.740 --> 09:56.800
Miss Tinasha.

09:58.750 --> 10:00.070
Good luck out there.

10:00.500 --> 10:02.870
I leave His Majesty to you.

10:04.180 --> 10:05.230
Understood.

10:12.210 --> 10:12.880
Come out!

10:12.880 --> 10:15.700
Senn! Karr! Mila! Nil! Kunai!

10:17.090 --> 10:17.820
Go forth!

10:29.800 --> 10:32.380
Recognize my will as command.

10:32.380 --> 10:34.940
Transformer resting in the earth 
and taking to the sky.

10:34.940 --> 10:37.900
I control and summon thy water.

10:37.900 --> 10:40.820
Know that thou art manifested by my name.

10:53.710 --> 10:54.590
Okay.

10:59.730 --> 11:00.800
Are you all right?

11:00.800 --> 11:01.980
Yes.

11:01.980 --> 11:04.290
Thank you, Your Majesty.

11:16.150 --> 11:18.650
<b>Aderayya    Servant to Leonora</b>

11:25.340 --> 11:26.410
Oscar!

11:28.660 --> 11:29.870
Oscar?

11:36.420 --> 11:37.510
That's...

11:40.250 --> 11:42.430
Recognize my will as command.

11:42.430 --> 11:45.510
Transformer acting as the pivot 
on which the world turns.

11:45.510 --> 11:47.510
I deny thee.

11:47.970 --> 11:50.930
Deny, deny.

11:51.250 --> 11:53.820
Deny, deny...

12:02.960 --> 12:04.710
What's going on?

12:05.410 --> 12:07.580
Sorry to call you so late at night.

12:09.290 --> 12:10.980
You're stopping time?

12:10.980 --> 12:11.540
Yes.

12:13.060 --> 12:14.500
A natural poison?

12:14.770 --> 12:16.380
Wait, is it alkakia?

12:16.380 --> 12:17.190
Yes.

12:18.970 --> 12:20.340
He's a lost cause.

12:20.830 --> 12:24.230
It's a deadly poison that no one's survived, 
dating back to the Dark Age.

12:24.880 --> 12:26.680
Don't write him off yet.

12:26.680 --> 12:28.010
I'll figure something out.

12:28.010 --> 12:29.220
How, exactly?

12:29.670 --> 12:31.220
I'll make a blood serum.

12:31.220 --> 12:33.180
For a poison that kills instantly?

12:33.180 --> 12:34.690
How on earth will you do that?

12:35.350 --> 12:37.310
With my body.

12:37.670 --> 12:38.390
What?

12:39.080 --> 12:43.840
Inside my body, there's plenty of magic 
and time stands still.

12:43.840 --> 12:46.980
I can hold out for about a full day, 
even with this poison.

12:47.420 --> 12:50.120
I'll use that time to use magic 
and create antibodies.

12:50.120 --> 12:51.870
Don't be stupid!

12:51.870 --> 12:54.330
Even if you make the serum, 
you'll die in the process!

12:54.330 --> 12:57.250
Not that you can use magic 
in such debilitating pain!

12:58.830 --> 13:01.710
That's why I'm asking for your help.

13:02.130 --> 13:05.130
Also, I'm used to handling pain.

13:07.910 --> 13:08.640
I refuse.

13:08.930 --> 13:10.350
Please.

13:10.350 --> 13:11.300
No way!

13:11.300 --> 13:12.610
Something's wrong with you!

13:12.610 --> 13:13.700
You're insane!

13:13.700 --> 13:15.300
Just find another man!

13:16.170 --> 13:17.400
Please.

13:23.860 --> 13:27.910
Are you saying this man's worth 
risking your life for?

13:27.910 --> 13:28.950
Yes.

13:35.010 --> 13:36.750
You two help me out, too.

13:45.010 --> 13:46.700
Lady Lucrezia.

13:49.930 --> 13:55.320
This has never been done before, 
so I don't know how long it'll take.

13:55.320 --> 13:57.270
You might end up dying first.

13:59.040 --> 14:02.780
If I'd known this would happen, 
I'd have worked out a little more.

14:02.780 --> 14:05.760
A bit more muscle wouldn't make a difference.

14:05.760 --> 14:08.970
Just try not to lose your sanity.

14:08.970 --> 14:11.200
It'll be a real pain 
if your magic goes haywire.

14:11.540 --> 14:12.970
I'll keep that in mind.

14:17.270 --> 14:20.330
If I die, please finish the spell.

14:20.330 --> 14:21.410
Got it.

14:24.770 --> 14:28.640
Also, please erase all of his memories of me.

14:28.640 --> 14:29.760
No can do.

14:30.130 --> 14:33.600
If you die, I'll make him bear 
the burden for the rest of his life.

14:35.900 --> 14:37.090
Please go on.

14:48.580 --> 14:49.650
Your Majesty!

14:52.250 --> 14:53.380
What's this?

14:53.380 --> 14:55.180
Please don't overexert yourself.

14:55.590 --> 14:57.940
Huh? What happened to me?

14:57.940 --> 15:00.460
You were sick and bedridden.

15:00.830 --> 15:03.410
We were all worried about you.

15:03.880 --> 15:05.850
Was it that bad?

15:09.050 --> 15:11.660
No wonder everything's a blur.

15:12.140 --> 15:14.210
I feel like someone's missing.

15:14.930 --> 15:16.750
I'm sure it's all in your head.

15:17.370 --> 15:18.610
I see.

15:18.610 --> 15:21.180
That aside, would you like something to eat?

15:21.180 --> 15:23.440
No, I'm going back to sleep.

15:23.440 --> 15:24.270
Sorry.

15:24.600 --> 15:26.090
I understand.

15:26.090 --> 15:27.760
We'll be taking our leave,

15:27.760 --> 15:29.580
so please call us if you need anything.

15:50.770 --> 15:51.660
Norman.

15:52.220 --> 15:55.680
Do you know anything from before I fell ill?

15:59.020 --> 16:01.070
No, never mind.

16:01.070 --> 16:02.940
Sorry for asking a weird question.

16:04.350 --> 16:05.220
Your Majesty.

16:06.910 --> 16:10.110
Have you decided who you'll take as queen yet?

16:10.750 --> 16:11.710
My queen?

16:12.420 --> 16:15.470
I believe it's about time 
you thought about your heir.

16:16.050 --> 16:19.620
Please choose someone 
who meets the requirements.

16:21.870 --> 16:22.830
<i>Oscar.</i>

16:27.130 --> 16:28.290
Tinasha.

16:46.480 --> 16:48.180
What are you doing?

16:50.580 --> 16:54.900
After we silenced all your subjects 
and tampered with your memories...

16:55.360 --> 16:56.730
Where's Tinasha?

17:01.460 --> 17:02.910
What on earth happened?

17:03.370 --> 17:07.100
The alkakia you were poisoned with 
has spread throughout her body.

17:14.900 --> 17:16.550
Is she alive?

17:16.550 --> 17:19.550
We wouldn't leave her here if she was dead.

17:20.660 --> 17:23.230
It's a mystery as to why she's not.

17:23.230 --> 17:26.320
The incredible pain 
should have driven her insane,

17:26.320 --> 17:28.520
but she was chanting incantations to the end.

17:28.520 --> 17:29.860
I swear.

17:29.860 --> 17:32.660
I wanted her to find a man 
because I thought she'd settle down,

17:32.660 --> 17:33.930
but it only made her worse.

17:34.340 --> 17:36.740
Why is she hovering on the brink of death?

17:36.740 --> 17:37.970
Sorry.

17:45.930 --> 17:49.090
No woman would want someone 
to see her like this.

17:49.090 --> 17:52.590
But she got these wounds because of me, right?

18:16.730 --> 18:18.700
You've finally come to.

18:21.060 --> 18:22.370
Lucrezia.

18:24.270 --> 18:26.610
If you can walk, then come here.

18:26.610 --> 18:28.330
I'll heal those wounds for you.

18:35.570 --> 18:36.650
Tinasha.

18:37.530 --> 18:39.530
I would have visited you if you'd waited.

18:41.140 --> 18:43.520
I teleported here, so it was instant.

18:43.520 --> 18:44.850
Were you busy?

18:44.850 --> 18:46.180
I don't mind.

18:46.180 --> 18:48.060
Is your body okay now?

18:48.060 --> 18:48.810
Yes.

18:48.810 --> 18:50.050
I'm back at full health.

18:50.050 --> 18:52.080
Then strip down for me later.

18:52.080 --> 18:53.020
Why?

18:53.020 --> 18:54.980
I want to make sure you're fully healed.

18:54.980 --> 18:56.650
I am!

18:56.650 --> 18:59.200
I swear, what's going on in that head of yours?

18:59.200 --> 19:02.160
I should be asking how you see <i>me</i>.

19:02.870 --> 19:03.510
What?

19:03.870 --> 19:05.250
As a contract holder.

19:05.250 --> 19:06.980
No, what else?

19:06.980 --> 19:08.330
Also, you're important to me.

19:08.620 --> 19:09.650
I see.

19:12.230 --> 19:13.830
What's wrong with you?

19:14.670 --> 19:16.850
No, well...

19:16.850 --> 19:19.120
You should think about things a little more.

19:19.120 --> 19:19.790
Okay?

19:20.870 --> 19:24.600
And so, I have no idea why he laughed at me.

19:24.900 --> 19:27.810
Miss Tinasha, you don't realize it?

19:27.810 --> 19:29.530
Realize what?

19:29.530 --> 19:30.770
Lady Tinasha.

19:30.770 --> 19:34.860
As His Majesty said, 
please think about it a bit more.

19:37.090 --> 19:41.940
For example, would you have done 
what you did for any other contract holder?

19:43.870 --> 19:47.040
I think it'd depend on the circumstances.

19:47.420 --> 19:49.500
His Majesty is special to you, right?

19:49.760 --> 19:50.740
Probably.

19:51.180 --> 19:52.880
Yeah, that's right.

19:52.880 --> 19:54.540
And why is he special?

19:55.010 --> 19:56.260
I wonder why.

19:57.060 --> 19:58.150
I'm fond of him?

19:59.440 --> 20:01.690
Isn't he more than a contract holder?

20:01.690 --> 20:05.420
Someone that sexually attracts you?

20:05.420 --> 20:06.010
Eh?

20:08.590 --> 20:09.930
Is that what's going on?!

20:09.930 --> 20:11.850
Don't ask <i>me</i> that!

20:12.580 --> 20:15.980
Wh-Who here thinks I love Oscar?

20:17.020 --> 20:17.820
Y...

20:19.420 --> 20:21.260
You can't be serious!

20:28.330 --> 20:30.460
Be a little more honest with yourself.

20:30.460 --> 20:33.560
You've loved him for a long time now.

20:33.560 --> 20:34.290
How?!

20:34.560 --> 20:36.110
How, you ask...

20:36.580 --> 20:38.270
I'm not the one to ask.

20:38.700 --> 20:40.120
I should be asking <i>you</i>.

20:40.120 --> 20:41.880
How can you not realize it?

20:41.880 --> 20:42.770
What?

20:43.340 --> 20:46.010
I'm in love with Oscar?

20:49.990 --> 20:51.500
I need to kill him.

20:51.500 --> 20:53.040
Why is <i>that</i> your conclusion?

20:53.040 --> 20:54.480
Are you an idiot?!

20:58.470 --> 20:59.610
Tinasha.

20:59.940 --> 21:01.930
Oscar, do you have a moment?

21:02.620 --> 21:04.140
What's this now?

21:04.140 --> 21:07.030
I've thought about it, 
and I really have no idea.

21:07.030 --> 21:11.490
So I'm asking everyone and taking
 the majority opinion as the answer.

21:12.330 --> 21:13.960
What are you up to?

21:14.370 --> 21:16.990
Am I in love with you?

21:18.130 --> 21:20.870
You really have just completely broken, huh?

21:21.970 --> 21:23.140
That's right.

21:23.140 --> 21:24.730
You just realized it?

21:25.790 --> 21:26.630
Come here.

21:43.660 --> 21:44.940
Why are you crying?

21:46.010 --> 21:47.940
I have no idea.

21:48.370 --> 21:49.250
But...

21:53.150 --> 21:55.580
I'm glad I met you.

21:55.900 --> 21:57.540
That's an honor to hear.

23:35.470 --> 23:40.020
~ Blank Slate Children ~
